OL,3,AFormer Ecuadorian president imprisoned
OL,4,Afor corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former president of Ecuador has been
OL,7,Fsentenced to five years in prison after
OL,8,Fbeing found guilty of taking bribes.
OL,10,FLenin Moreno insisted he had not taken
OL,11,Fmoney from a Chinese firm which secured
OL,12,Fa contract to build a hydroelectric
OL,13,Fplant in the Latin American nation.
OL,15,FThe 73-year-old will serve his sentence
OL,16,Funder house arrest due to his age and
OL,17,Fdisability, and has already indicated
OL,18,Fhis intention to appeal against the
OL,19,Fverdict after a court in the capital,
OL,20,FQuito, found him and 19 others guilty
OL,21,Fof corruption.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
