OL,3,AFormer Ecuadorian president imprisoned
OL,4,Afor corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoreno, who was president between 2017
OL,7,Fand 2021, is the third former
OL,8,FEcuadorian leader to be sentenced for
OL,9,Fcorruption.
